age":"/img/scene-clips/7355.webp","imageBytes":22892,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7355.mp4","videoBytes":170689,"duration":4.041667},"9ffbd5d61586":{"text":"The Ring was very frightening.","id":"9ffbd5d61586","source":"BTS 15 · #47","image":"/img/scene-clips/7368.webp","imageBytes":8988,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7368.mp4","videoBytes":104405,"duration":4.041667},"16af212c39f2":{"text":"Most of them are pure fiction.","id":"16af212c39f2","source":"BTS 15 · #45","image":"/img/scene-clips/7370.webp","imageBytes":20724,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7370.mp4","videoBytes":155578,"duration":4.041667},"beaef158752c":{"text":"When were these books written?","id":"beaef158752c","source":"BTS 15 · #64","image":"/img/scene-clips/7371.webp","imageBytes":19872,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7371.mp4","videoBytes":129576,"duration":4.041667},"2929b07f4bde":{"text":"No, but it was definitely scary.","id":"2929b07f4bde","source":"BTS 15 · #49","image":"/img/scene-clips/7403.webp","imageBytes":11892,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7403.mp4","videoBytes":104065,"duration":4.041667},"1e4e8c544e2c":{"text":"I like stories about superheroes.","id":"1e4e8c544e2c","source":"BTS 15 · #21","image":"/img/scene-clips/7427.webp","imageBytes":10868,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7427.mp4","videoBytes":99550,"duration":4.041667},"2dba8d8f47a8":{"text":"I like Cinderella and Snow White.","id":"2dba8d8f47a8","source":"BTS 15 · #81","image":"/img/scene-clips/7428.webp","imageBytes":16888,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7428.mp4","videoBytes":91543,"duration":4.041667},"bd623e13705b":{"text":"Have you read any romantic stories?","id":"bd623e13705b","source":"BTS 15 · #52","image":"/img/scene-clips/7467.webp","imageBytes":11504,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7467.mp4","videoBytes":115078,"duration":4.041667},"8fa373b282ed":{"text":"J.R.R. Tolkien created Middle-earth.","id":"8fa373b282ed","source":"BTS 15 · #29","image":"/img/scene-clips/7480.webp","imageBytes":15418,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7480.mp4","videoBytes":97679,"duration":4.041667},"21d5117b8bed":{"text":"Sherlock Holmes stories are amazing.","id":"21d5117b8bed","source":"BTS 15 · #91","image":"/img/scene-clips/7485.webp","imageBytes":18650,"video":"/videos/scene-clips/7485.mp4","videoBytes":111306,"duration":4.041667}},"examples":["This is a true story.","What is the scariest story you have read?","Fiction stories come from the writer's imagination.","Some fairy tales may have been inspired by real events.","I like stories about superheroes.","Do you prefer reading or listening to stories?","What is your favorite book?","Once upon a time, there was a brave knight.","The princess lived in a big castle.","The dragon was very scary.","In the end, they lived happily ever after.","Have you ever read a biography?","A biography is a true story about a real person.","What kind of stories do you like?","I like adventure stories.","She prefers mystery stories.","Can you tell me a story?","Let me tell you about what happened.","This really happened to me last year.","Danger, excitement, and interesting places are important.","The most interesting part of the story was the ending.","Who is your favorite character in the story?","Marvel and DC characters are fictional.","Some stories are based on true events.","The movie was adapted from a book.","The author wrote this story from her imagination.","Have you read Harry Potter?","Yes, it is a great fantasy series.","The Lord of the Rings is also fiction.","J.R.R. Tolkien created Middle-earth.","What is your opinion about the story?","I think poetry is harder to understand.","Good characters and an exciting plot are important.","Yes, I enjoy stories about exploration.","Yes, I liked how everything was resolved.","Would you recommend this book to a friend?","Yes, I think everyone should read it.","How long did it take you to finish the book?","It took me three weeks to read it.","Do you read before going to bed?","Yes, I read for about thirty minutes.","What genre do you prefer?","Sometimes, but I prefer happy endings.","I enjoy science fiction and fantasy.","Have you read any novels by Stephen King?","Yes, his stories are very suspenseful.","Most of them are pure fiction.","The Ring was very frightening.","Did it give you nightmares?","No, but it was definitely scary.","Do you like horror stories?","Have you read any romantic stories?","What makes a good love story?","The characters must really care about each other.","Yes, poetry can be very beautiful.","Is poetry easier or harder to understand than stories?","I prefer reading because I can imagine the story.","What are some classic books?","When were these books written?","Pride and Prejudice and Wuthering Heights are classics.","Are they still popular today?","Yes, many people still read them.","Yes, I wrote a short story for school.","It was about a girl who found a magical forest.","Did your teacher like it?","Yes, she gave me an A on the assignment.","Do you want to be a writer?","Maybe, I think writing is fun.","Should a story have a moral lesson?","Not always, but some stories do have lessons.","What is your favorite fairy tale?","I like Cinderella and Snow White.","Do you believe in fairy tales?","Have you ever read a mystery novel?","Yes, I like trying to guess who the criminal is.","Can you usually solve the mystery before the end?","Sometimes, but I am often surprised.","What is the best mystery story you have read?","Sherlock Holmes stories are amazing.","Because the detective is very clever and logical.","Yes, I enjoy stories about animals having adventures."]}
